		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Wispy, toadstool-covered faerie maiden with long sheets of fungus hair.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 12, <strong>HP</strong> 16, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 touch +2 (1d4 + stunning touch), <strong>MV</strong> near (swim), <strong>S</strong> +0, <strong>D</strong> +2, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> +1, <strong>W</strong> +1, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 3</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Plant Queen</strong>. LV 3 or lower plant creatures hearing nymph's commands, CHA 15+ or utterly charmed for 1d8 days.</p><p></p><p><strong>Spore Touch</strong>. CON 12+ or 1d4 CON damage.</p><p></p><p><strong>Stunning Glance</strong>. Nymph can choose to stun all mortals within near who behold her, CHA 12+ to avoid.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
